The use of guidelines and citations to the EBSE papers in the re-
views increased in the SE with respect to the OS/FE studies, as
shown in Table 12 . The increase in the use of guidelines signiﬁ-
cantly correlated with quality of the SLRs by Kitchenham et al.Table 5 (continued )
